  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9657726199366152\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></b><br />\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9657726199366152\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Taigi Unicode;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">曹麗華</span></span></b></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9657726199366152\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Taigi Unicode;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></b></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9657726199366152\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我一直想beh kap你行hit條山路<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />雖然你講已經食老bē哺塗豆--ah<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />雖然你講骨頭已經teh-beh拍鼓--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b></div>\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.9657726199366152\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></div>\n<a name='more'></a>我一直想beh kap你行hit條山路<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tī天清雲白ê日子<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tī日頭光iàⁿ-iàⁿ ê好時機<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我一直想beh kap你行hit條山路<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tī hit條山路內底<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />有咱青春ê美夢<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />有咱共同ê記持</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></div>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我一直想beh kap你行hit條山路<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tsit擺gún無beh koh攻山頭拚生死--ah<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />只想beh kap你勻勻仔行<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />看草木青翠<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />聽鶯啼鳥語</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></div>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0pt -0.05pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.05pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我一直想beh kap你行hit條山路<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tī hit條山路內底<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kā你講我猶原是hit个愛peh山ê青春少年兄</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div>\n</b>"
